cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Nayak
    given-names: Bishwaswarup
    affiliation: "Department of Physics, Indian Institute of Science, Bengaluru"
    email: priyaa@iisc.ac.in
title: "CR3BP Manifold-Assisted Transfer Design"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-23
url: "https://github.com/Bishwaswarup/cr3bp-manifold-transfer"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Python pipeline for low-energy Earth–Moon transfer design via invariant
  manifolds of halo orbits in the Circular Restricted Three-Body Problem.
  Includes halo orbit computation (Richardson guess + differential correction +
  pseudo-arclength continuation), manifold tube generation, Poincaré section
  intersection search, and ΔV budget computation.
keywords:
  - astrodynamics
  - CR3BP
  - halo orbits
  - invariant manifolds
  - Poincaré section
  - low-energy transfer
  - Earth-Moon
  - trajectory design
references:
  - type: book
    authors:
      - family-names: Koon
